Privacy Policy for Lutong AI

Effective Date: May 17, 2026

Welcome to Lutong AI. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how the Lutong AI mobile application (“App”) handles information when you use our services.

1. Information We Collect

Lutong AI does not collect, store, or sell personal information from users.

We do not require account registration and we do not maintain user databases containing personal data.

2. AI Request Processing

When you send messages, prompts, or questions through the App, the content is temporarily transmitted to a third-party AI service provider in order to generate responses.

These requests are processed externally by the AI provider and are not permanently stored by Lutong AI.

Examples of information sent may include:

User prompts or questions
Chat messages entered into the App

Please avoid submitting sensitive personal information in your prompts.

3. Third-Party Services

Lutong AI uses third-party AI infrastructure and APIs to provide AI-generated responses.

These third-party providers may process requests according to their own privacy policies and terms.

Examples may include:

OpenAI

We encourage users to review the privacy policies of any third-party providers used by the App.

4. Data Storage

Lutong AI does not permanently store:

Chat history
Personal information
User prompts
Device information

Any temporary processing required to generate AI responses is handled in real time.

5. Children’s Privacy

Lutong AI is not directed toward children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

6. Security

While we do not store user data, we take reasonable measures to ensure communications with third-party services are transmitted securely.

However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted within the App or on the official distribution page.

8. Contact Us

If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, you may contact the developer of Lutong AI through the app store listing or official support channels.
